<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices mostly steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices mostly steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were mostly steady Monday with moderate export demand noted, cash sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;We're seeing a little buying overseas but that's about it,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>He added that domestic trade was at a seasonal lull as farmers finished corn and soybean harvest and wheat crops went into dormancy.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton     Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   178-180			up 1/unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188-190			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	     225			  unc</p>
